Debug agent enable ({{ debug_agent.switch }})
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Switch **{{ debug_agent.switch }}** enables or disables the on-board debug
agent. Disable it to attach an external ICE to the JTAG header of the SoM.

